#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""codesnap-cli reimplementation.

Generates code snapshots. This implementation mirrors the CLI surface of the
original tool; image rendering is intentionally minimal (a valid SVG/PNG is
emitted) because the focus is on CLI/behavioral fidelity.
"""

